---
title: Tab placeholder
style: |
  /* The drag placeholder ([[ui/app/stage/index.md]], Reordering): while a
     tab is carried, a tint in the tab's own size and shape holds its slot —
     drawn where release will drop it. Every tab is one control line, so the
     slot's height is the sum the tab states — line, the label's padding, the
     border — while the width is the carried tab's own, arriving from
     behaviour. The tint is the shared one — mixed from currentColor, like
     the ghost hover's, so it reads on whatever ground it lands. */
  .tab-placeholder {
    display: block;
    flex: none;
    height: calc(var(--line-control) + 2 * var(--space-4) + 2 * 1px);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: var(--tab-border);
    border-radius: var(--tab-radius);
    background: var(--drag-placeholder-background);
  }
---
<span class="tab-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></span>
